WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.285 --> 00:00:04.776
- Oh my God, who is this? (laughs)

00:00:04.776 --> 00:00:07.359
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:11.684
- Is he trying to be Indian?

00:00:11.684 --> 00:00:13.984
- I'm gonna go with
Indian for this person.

00:00:13.984 --> 00:00:14.817
Am I right?

00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:15.742
- [Voiceover] Yeah.

00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:16.830
(bell dings)

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.304
- Oh God, it's Ashton Kutcher!

00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:19.137
I remember this!

00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:19.970
- No! No!

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.249
What the (bleep)!

00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:23.881
- Looks like he just
rubbed dirt on his face

00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:26.306
and put a mustache on
and a really bad wig.

00:00:26.306 --> 00:00:27.550
- It's sad because Ashton Kutcher

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.045
was totally my celeb crush when I was

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:31.564
in elementary school.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.564
- Never dress up as an Indian again.

00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:37.034
- I'm guessing he's supposed to be Chinese

00:00:37.034 --> 00:00:38.813
because he's wearing silk robes,

00:00:38.813 --> 00:00:41.264
he has a really long mustache.

00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:43.268
- So, I'm guessing Chinese.

00:00:43.268 --> 00:00:44.968
(bell dings)

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:47.021
- Even if you want to do a loving tribute

00:00:47.021 --> 00:00:50.376
to the genre of kung fu, do you really

00:00:50.376 --> 00:00:53.559
need to put on this fake mustache?

00:00:53.559 --> 00:00:55.436
- He looks more like the rat

00:00:55.436 --> 00:00:58.303
that betrayed Harry's
parents in Harry Potter.

00:00:58.303 --> 00:00:59.638
- They definitely didn't try.

00:00:59.638 --> 00:01:01.305
This is a white guy.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.665
- I don't know who she's supposed to be

00:01:03.665 --> 00:01:05.056
'cause she look like a white woman.

00:01:05.056 --> 00:01:06.291
- Yeah, there's Emma Stone playing

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:08.374
some white girl in a hat.

00:01:09.621 --> 00:01:11.140
- I think they just gave
her some little freckles

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.174
and they're like, "Yeah, that's exotic."

00:01:13.174 --> 00:01:14.328
- No, I would never
guess that she's supposed

00:01:14.328 --> 00:01:15.790
to be part-Asian.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.655
I would assume she's in some
Desperate Housewives show.

00:01:19.655 --> 00:01:21.198
- She looks all-white to me.

00:01:21.198 --> 00:01:22.948
They didn't even try!

00:01:24.808 --> 00:01:26.012
- Don't tell me she's
supposed to be black.

00:01:26.012 --> 00:01:27.535
She's not supposed to be
black with this curly hair.

00:01:27.535 --> 00:01:28.410
Hispanic, maybe?

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.155
- Is she supposed to be
a biracial black woman?

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:31.902
(bell dings)

00:01:31.902 --> 00:01:33.699
- Why would they make her Afro-Cuban?

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.084
There are too many
Afro-Cubans in the world.

00:01:37.084 --> 00:01:38.735
- He looks like Rachel Dolezal.

00:01:38.735 --> 00:01:39.694
- The fact that someone like her

00:01:39.694 --> 00:01:41.085
goes out of their way, I think,

00:01:41.085 --> 00:01:43.520
to aid in humanitarian
causes in other countries

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.065
is like, "Yeah, I'll play
an Afro-Cuban woman."

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.304
Like, no. That's fucked up.

00:01:48.304 --> 00:01:49.927
- You can't train to be a black woman.

00:01:49.927 --> 00:01:50.760
Sorry.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.782
I've been training all my life,

00:01:51.782 --> 00:01:53.366
and I still struggle with the role.

00:01:53.366 --> 00:01:55.171
- You can't just put on some makeup

00:01:55.171 --> 00:01:57.428
and some stereotypical clothes

00:01:57.428 --> 00:01:59.389
and suddenly embody that culture

00:01:59.389 --> 00:02:01.639
in a true and realistic way.

00:02:01.639 --> 00:02:02.472
You just can't.

00:02:02.472 --> 00:02:04.405
- Because name recognition and box office

00:02:04.405 --> 00:02:07.156
success are not valid reasons.

00:02:07.156 --> 00:02:09.404
I mean, movies starring people of color,

00:02:09.404 --> 00:02:12.280
like Fast 7, they do very well.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.363
- Please stop doing this!

00:02:20.345 --> 00:02:21.465
(squeaks)

